      "Baseline model: robust (Huber) two-part regression on daily kWh \u2014 base load estimated from off-production intervals with a degree-day response; production surplus regressed on per-product unit volumes, degree-days and calendar effects. Fitted on the baseline quarter only (no leakage).",
